# HP39gs stock launch through the original APLET UI and USB disk.
# HP39/40 2.22 RECEIVE FROM order:
#   HP39 (IrDA), HP39/40 (USB), HP39/40 (Ser),
#   USB Disk drive, Ser. Disk drive.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6

# With the USB cable asserted during boot, HP39gs can still be settling its
# startup state when the historical 7s APLET tap arrives.  Enter HOME first,
# matching the already-stable HP40gs Stock choreography, then open APLET.
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-usb-disk
20600 tap enter

# Wait for the directory transaction before selecting the remote Aplet.
21100 host-gate directory
0 capture remote-aplet
1500 tap enter
3000 capture lazy-fetch
4000 host-gate

0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter
